# Harness-local EOL portability contract (mirrors the j1h2b B1-R2 rule).
#
# Every text file under j1h2c-retailer-recovery/ MUST check out with LF
# endings on EVERY host, overriding any core.autocrlf setting, so the strict
# no-CR byte gate (tools/validate-static.mjs) fails for content reasons,
# never host reasons.
* text=auto eol=lf
